  "description": "Audit and repair Gaia user-tree timelines so every skill's current rank is explained by a chain of Hero's Journey events. Trigger this skill when: a contributor's profile chart shows a stale rank (e.g. still shows 3★ after a demotion to 1★); someone asks to \"trace what happened\" to a skill's rank; `validate_timelines.py` is failing in CI; you need to backfill missing `demote` or `rank_up` events before cutting a release; a skill was reclassified or Star-Bar-reset and the user tree was never updated; or any time the registry node and user tree disagree on a skill's current level. Uses `scripts/trace_timeline.py` (dry-run + apply) and `scripts/validate_timelines.py` (CI gate). Do NOT hand-edit `timeline[]` arrays — the script synthesises properly labelled events with `previousValue`/`newValue` so the rank chart plots correctly.",
